  "description": "• Spacious studio apartment extending to approximately 57.7 sq.m.\n• Bright and generously proportioned open-plan accommodation\n• High vaulted ceilings with exposed steel beams\n• Large windows providing excellent natural light\n• Contemporary fitted kitchen with integrated appliances\n• Designated sleeping area\n• Modern shower room\n• Ample storage and attractive contemporary finishes\n• Convenient city centre location just off Grantham Street\n• Close to cafés, restaurants, shops and public transport\n\nBright, spacious and full of character, The Mews is a contemporary studio apartment just off Synge Street in Dublin’s city centre. Extending to approximately 57.7 sq.m., the property combines generous open-plan accommodation with distinctive architectural features and an abundance of natural light.\n\nHigh vaulted ceilings and exposed steel beams create an impressive sense of space, while large windows complement the modern interiors. The accommodation comprises a spacious living and dining area, a contemporary fitted kitchen with integrated appliances, a designated sleeping area and a modern shower room finished with quality tiling and sanitary ware.\n\nThoughtfully designed to maximise comfort and functionality, the apartment offers ample storage and plenty of space for relaxing, dining and entertaining. The fitted kitchen provides excellent storage and preparation space, contributing to the practical layout and attractive contemporary finish throughout.\n\nThe location offers an excellent choice of cafés, restaurants, bars and independent shops around nearby Camden Street and Portobello. St Stephen’s Green and Grafton Street are within walking distance, while nearby public transport links provide convenient access across the city. With city-centre business districts close by, The Mews is ideally positioned for those seeking a convenient home within easy reach of the city’s many amenities.",
